From 7d0a9e386705f86e3547c18ff06a413fda9c83d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:24:41 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 356/371] pirates: ship repair benches on the Port Royal docks
 (3 benches, easy / medium / hard; five little repair games: scrub the hull,
 saw a plank, brace the frame, hammer nails, plug leaks with pitch; gold per
 round, friends can join), ported from the original game: AI + client + DC
 classes 251/252 at the end of pirates.dc (client patch 54 = v497 published
 first, then a full restart; rollback = want-repair-game 0 + AI restart)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
